    <div class="info-card"><h2>דרישות לקובץ</h2><ul class="check-list"><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>קבצים: PDF, PNG או JPEG, עד 100MB</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>רזולוציה: [300] dpi בגודל ההדפסה</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>שוליים (bleed) של [2] מ״מ מכל צד</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>למדבקות בצורה חופשית — קו חיתוך בשכבה נפרדת (CutContour)</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>אין קובץ מוכן? כתבו לנו — נעזור להכין אותו.</span></li></ul></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h2>איסוף ותשלום</h2><ul class="check-list"><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>איסוף עצמי מרח׳ שטמפפר 5, נתניה — חינם</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>תשלום מחוץ לאתר: מזומן, אשראי, Bit או העברה בנקאית</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>מינימום הזמנה — 60 ₪ כולל מע״מ</span></li></ul></div>
  </div>
